WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.660
The module uses a small healthcare-style teaching
database Patients

00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:11.781
is the main entity Admissions lab results and
prescriptions connect back to patients

00:00:13.503 --> 00:00:19.107
Admissions also connect to departments The review
queue contains one

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:24.557
patient ID and one deliberate NULL That NULL is
important because we will use it

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:30.268
to demonstrate the NOT IN trap The database loads
automatically

00:00:30.295 --> 00:00:31.084
in the browser
